msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was no one around, nor any source of light.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Groping through the darkness, "
"⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫he⟪k:5⟫ found the front door,⟪k:6⟫which was sealed shut with a heavy bar."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’atrio era deserto, e non vi era alcuna fonte di luce.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Vagando nel buio, ⟪k:3⟫"
